{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6f5ce27073c618b3","name":"Dual Weapon Mastery III","source":{"id":"source:reference-6f5ce27073c618b3","title":"Dual Weapon Mastery III","revision":18127,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:37:57Z","sha256":"07fccb976a15322d96b501a946b0f792042cc7a11f023a2bf2adb8896aa0ee73","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18127","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Dual%20Weapon%20Mastery%20III&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6f5ce27073c618b3","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can wield two weapons or a double weapon without penalty.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," 17, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +11, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dual Weapon Mastery II"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dual_Weapon_Mastery_II","referenceId":"reference:c7d88ad0313597e9"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Effect:"]}," When you attack with two weapons, or with both ends of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Double Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Double_Weapon"}," as part of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action, you take no penalty on your attack rolls. You only gain this benefit if you are wielding a weapon with which you are proficient. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"}," cannot be used in one hand, so this feat has no effect on them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Normal:"]}," If you use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full_Attack"}," Action to make more than one attack on your turn, you take a -10 penalty on all attack rolls for the round.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
